Do people still use bookmarklets?<p>I wrote this one to remove all &lt;iframe&gt; elements, which is where most of the worst distractions live.  I mostly only use it when a site has gone too far.<p><pre><code>    javascript:(function () {
        const rm = () =&gt; document.querySelectorAll(&#x27;iframe&#x27;)
            .forEach(f =&gt; f.remove());
        let timeout;
        const debouncedRm = () =&gt; {
            clearTimeout(timeout);
            timeout = setTimeout(rm, 100);
        };
        rm();
        new MutationObserver(debouncedRm)
            .observe(document.body, {
                childList: true, 
                subtree: true
            });
    })();</code></pre>
